        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-1794263606047-afmpnw",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Fly from Uyuni to La Paz.\n\nOn arrival, take a city sightseeing tour of about four hours.\n\nYou'll see street markets selling traditional festive costumes and visit the Witches' Market, San Francisco Church, the Government Palace, Plaza Murillo and the cathedral.\n\nThe Killi Killi viewpoint offers panoramic views of La Paz. In the Miraflores neighbourhood, you'll see an open-air museum devoted to the Tiwanaku culture.\n\nThe tour ends with a drive through the neighbourhoods of Obrajes, Calacoto and La Florida, near the Valley of the Moon.\n\nReturn to your hotel and spend the night in La Paz."
    },
